W44-151 Mechanism B W44-29 widen — paired interleaved A/B bench (72 cells × 2 modes)
====================================================================================

Date: 2026-05-21
Commit (post-revert): <commit>
Branch: main
Host: $(hostname)
Run: cargo run --release --features '__expert butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel' \
       --example w44_151_w44_29_widen_ab > benchmarks/w44_151_w44_29_widen_2026-05-21.tsv

Status: HONEST-STOP — gate REVERTED; constants + helpers + bench KEPT
================================================================================

MECHANISM
=========

Widened W44-29 outer dispatch gate by ORing in a new branch:

    w44_151_gate = (distance >= HIGH_D_PHOTO_MIN_DISTANCE)            // 3.0
                && (percentile_mask1x1(25) >= W44_151_HIGH_MASK_P25_MIN) // 85.0

Composes with W44-29 (mask_median<50) and W44-91 (mask_median∈[50,80)) by OR.
Does NOT escalate to variant Z (W44-96 requires mask_median<50 which 1418519
fails at mask=92). 1418519 lands on the DEFAULT `high_d_photo_smooth_suppressed()`
table (dct32x32=1.34 vs libjxl stock 1.48, ~9.5% lift).

Reuses the W44-149 audit's `mask_p25 >= 85` discriminator
(W44_150_PHOTO_W44_117_MASK_P25_MIN). On the 41 CID22 validation photos,
only 1418519 (mask_p25=88.88) crosses the threshold; nearest CONTROL is
7552578 at 77.90 (11pp safety margin). 1025469 REJECT at 60.64.

