  docs/LIBJXL_DIVERGENCES.md Section F (KNOWN-BUG clusters): 1418519
    d=5/6 cluster entry updated to mention W44-151 ruled out the broad
    [d=3..6] band; the cluster remains OPEN with a narrower W44-152
